{"about":["Experience Rally Cross originally released on the PlayStation® console, enhanced with up-rendering, rewind, quick save, and custom video filters.","Download Rally Cross™ today and rev your engines for some seriously dirty driving.","Race 20 cars and trucks at breakneck speed across six game modes, including Solo Race, Head-On and Unlimited Laps. Go off-road across 18 axle-busting rally terrains including snow, sand and sludge.","This title has been converted from the PlayStation® version to the PlayStation®4 and PlayStation®5 consoles and provides newly added features. Consequently, there may be times where the title plays differently from the PlayStation® version, or where some features may cause the title to not function properly. This version does not support the PlayStation® console’s peripherals, therefore some functionality may not be available."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202312/1221/2caf50ec1410d27887c79906bd5c99dc0d5d8ad2d7521ebb.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202312/1221/2caf50ec1410d27887c79906bd5c99dc0d5d8ad2d7521ebb.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202312/1221/5ae9ab3afdd520021c1f9aad8d33d3b4820cffcfc700d249.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202312/1221/5ae9ab3afdd520021c1f9aad8d33d3b4820cffcfc700d249.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202312/1221/83ebb5379fe3eda09dcf5dadb700b06689410834818243fc.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202312/1221/83ebb5379fe3eda09dcf5dadb700b06689410834818243fc.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202312/1221/6c738800a7e60df03f1e8ae821e8e11b492da60d3a0695aa.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202312/1221/6c738800a7e60df03f1e8ae821e8e11b492da60d3a0695aa.jpg?w=